  "instructions": [
    "Heat 2 tablespoons of oil in a large claypot over medium-high heat.",
    "Add the diced onion and cook until browned, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the lamb shoulder and cook until browned on all sides, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the oat milk, beurre monte, cumin, coriander, paprika, salt, and black pepper. Stir to combine.",
    "Bring the mixture to a simmer, then cover the claypot and transfer it to the oven.",
    "Braise the lamb for 2 hours, or until tender and falling apart.",
    "Stir in the chopped cilantro and serve hot."
